3. The desktop grid should be: 
```css
.masonry {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  grid-auto-rows: clamp(220px, 22vw, 300px);
  gap: 16px;
  align-items: stretch;
}
.item-1 { grid-area: 1 / 1 / 2 / 3; }
.item-2 { grid-area: 1 / 3 / 2 / 4; }
.item-3 { grid-area: 2 / 3 / 3 / 4; }
.item-4 { grid-area: 1 / 4 / 3 / 5; }
.item-5 { grid-area: 2 / 1 / 3 / 3; }
```

5. For mobile, replace the max-width: 760px `.masonry` block with: 
```css
@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .masonry {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    grid-auto-rows: auto;
  }
  .masonry-item { grid-area: auto !important; aspect-ratio: auto; }
  .item-1 { aspect-ratio: 4/3; }
  .item-2 { aspect-ratio: 4/5; }
  .item-3 { aspect-ratio: 4/3; }
  .item-4 { aspect-ratio: 4/5; }
  .item-5 { aspect-ratio: 16/9; }
}
```
